  "instructions": {
    "zh": "回想近四周自己有一定选择余地的普通小事，按每句话实际出现的频率选择，从1从不到5几乎总是；没有相关情境、没有选择余地或不愿回答时可选NA。20条原创题分别观察时间催促、竞争式比较、普通等待烦躁和自选活动难停下，每部分5题、2条相反表述按6减有效评分；至少3条有效才显示一位小数均分。NA不补零，不足明确保留。四部分各自解释，不相加、不评最高人格、不分固定A/B类型；A/B概念及混合表现会在正文说明。它不是Jenkins、Bortner、临床筛查或心脏风险工具，不评健康、能力、善恶或工作适配。",
    "en": "Recall ordinary activities over the past four weeks where you had some choice. Rate how often each statement applied from 1 Never to 5 Almost always. Choose NA when context or choice was absent, information is insufficient or you prefer not to answer. Twenty original items separately explore felt time urgency, competitive comparison, irritation during ordinary waits and difficulty stopping chosen activities. Each part has five items, two oppositely worded as six minus a valid response; at least three ratings permit a one-decimal mean. NA is excluded without zero-filling and insufficient information stays explicit. Parts remain separate without a total, highest-score personality or fixed A/B assignment; the body explains the framework and mixed patterns. This is no Jenkins, Bortner, clinical screening or cardiac-risk instrument and assesses no health, ability, morality or job fit."
